{
  "title": "[DEV] PickUp Platform Core Monitoring Dashboard",
  "description": "PickUp 개발환경(env:development) 핵심 주요 지표 대시보드 (APM, Concurrency, JVM, MySQL DBM, Redis, K8s Pods)",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "kube_namespace",
      "prefix": "kube_namespace",
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "# ⚡ PickUp 개발환경 (development) 핵심 모니터링 대시보드\n**서비스**: `pickup-api` | **환경**: `development` | **네임스페이스**: `pickup`\n- **주요 관측 영역**: API Performance (RED), Tomcat Thread & HikariCP Pool 동시성, JVM 메모리/GC, MySQL DBM & InnoDB Lock, Redis 캐시, Kubernetes Pod 리소스",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "🚀 1. APM & Service Overview (RED Metrics)",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "요청 수 (Total Throughput)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:trace.servlet.request.hits{env:$env,service:$service}.as_rate()",
                  "aggregator": "avg"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "평균 응답시간 (Avg Latency)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:trace.servlet.request.duration{env:$env,service:$service}",
                  "aggregator": "avg"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "p95 응답시간 (p95 Latency)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "p95:trace.servlet.request.duration{env:$env,service:$service}",
                  "aggregator": "avg"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "에러율 (Error Rate)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:trace.servlet.request.errors{env:$env,service:$service}.as_rate() / sum:trace.servlet.request.hits{env:$env,service:$service}.as_rate() * 100",
                  "aggregator": "avg"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "API Throughput (RPS) & Errors",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:trace.servlet.request.hits{env:$env,service:$service}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:trace.servlet.request.errors{env:$env,service:$service}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "red",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "API Latency Distribution (Avg, p95, p99)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:trace.servlet.request.duration{env:$env,service:$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "p95:trace.servlet.request.duration{env:$env,service:$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "p99:trace.servlet.request.duration{env:$env,service:$service}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "purple",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "⚡ 2. App Concurrency & Connection Pools (HikariCP & Tomcat)",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "HikariCP 풀 사용률 (%)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "max:hikaricp.connections.active{env:$env} / max:hikaricp.connections.max{env:$env} * 100",
                  "aggregator": "max"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "HikariCP 대기 커넥션 (Pending)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "max:hikaricp.connections.pending{env:$env}",
                  "aggregator": "max"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Tomcat Busy Thread 사용률 (%)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "max:tomcat.threads.busy{env:$env} / max:tomcat.threads.max{env:$env} * 100",
                  "aggregator": "max"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "HikariCP Connection Pool Status (Active vs Pending vs Max)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "max:hikaricp.connections.active{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "purple",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "max:hikaricp.connections.pending{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "red",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "max:hikaricp.connections.max{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "grey",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Tomcat Thread Pool (Busy Threads vs Total vs Max)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "max:tomcat.threads.busy{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "max:tomcat.threads.count{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "blue",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "max:tomcat.threads.max{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "grey",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "☕ 3. JVM & Memory Health (Java 21)",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "JVM Heap Memory Usage (Used vs Committed vs Max)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "jvm.heap_memory{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "purple",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "jvm.heap_memory_committed{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "blue",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "jvm.heap_memory_max{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "grey",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "JVM Garbage Collection (GC) Pause Time & Frequency",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:jvm.gc.pause.time{env:$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "JVM Live Thread Count",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:jvm.thread_count{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "green",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "🗄️ 4. MySQL Database & Concurrency Lock (DBM)",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "MySQL Running Threads",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:mysql.performance.threads_running{env:$env}",
                  "aggregator": "avg"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "InnoDB Lock Wait Rate (/sec)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:mysql.innodb.row_lock_waits{env:$env}.as_rate()",
                  "aggregator": "avg"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "MySQL Deadlocks Count",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:mysql.innodb.deadlocks{env:$env}.as_count()",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "InnoDB Row Lock Wait Time (ms) & Waits Rate",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:mysql.innodb.row_lock_time{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "red",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:mysql.innodb.row_lock_waits{env:$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "MySQL Connections (Running vs Connected Threads)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:mysql.performance.threads_running{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "orange",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:mysql.performance.threads_connected{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "blue",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "MySQL QPS & Slow Queries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:mysql.queries{env:$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "purple",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:mysql.performance.slow_queries{env:$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "red",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "🔴 5. Redis Cache Performance",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Redis Used Memory (Bytes)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:redis.mem.used{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "red",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Redis Operations Throughput (Ops/sec)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:redis.net.commands{env:$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "blue",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Redis Keyspace Hits vs Misses",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:redis.stats.keyspace_hits{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "green",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:redis.stats.keyspace_misses{env:$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "☸️ 6. Kubernetes Infrastructure & Pod Health",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "실행 중인 Pod 수 (Running Pods)",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:kubernetes.pods.running{env:$env,kube_namespace:$kube_namespace}",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Pod CPU Usage by Pod Name",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:kubernetes.cpu.usage.total{env:$env,kube_namespace:$kube_namespace} by {pod_name}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Pod Memory Working Set by Pod Name",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:kubernetes.memory.working_set{env:$env,kube_namespace:$kube_namespace} by {pod_name}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "purple",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Container Restarts Count",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:kubernetes.containers.restarts{env:$env,kube_namespace:$kube_namespace} by {pod_name}",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "red",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
